The Pryde’s EasiBalanced range of balancer pellets is here to make your 
life simple and keep your horses in pristine health.</description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3>Obesity In Horses?</h3><p>Obesity in horses is extremely common and largely results from overfeeding or when horses have free access to pastures that is too high in energy for them. The <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henneke_horse_body_condition_scoring_system" target="_blank">Henneke </a>horse body condition scoring system is a numerical scale used to evaluate this.</p><p>Feeding management requires a diet as low in energy as possible without restricting feed intake so much as to cause behavioural changes or health problems like ulcers.</p>























 


